  "motion": {
    "frames": 330,
    "functions": {
      "tf": "(t*NF - min(HISS_F, max(0, t*NF - HISS_F0)))/(NF - HISS_F)",
      "tq": "(t*NF - min(HISS_F, max(0, t*NF - HISS_F0)) - min(SPIN_W, max(0, t*NF - SPIN_F0)))/(NF - HISS_F - SPIN_W)",
      "rs": "t*NF - SPIN_F0",
      "hs": "t*NF - HISS_F0",
      "hover": "FLOAT_A*wave(CYC*tf(t) + 0.25, SKEW) + FLOAT_C",
      "drift": "DRIFT_A*sin(2*pi*CYC*tf(t))",
      "breath": "0.5 - 0.5*cos(2*pi*CYC*tf(t))",
      "rear": "smoother(hs(t)/HI_IN)*(1 - smoother((hs(t) - HI_HOLD)/HI_RELAX))",
      "coil": "smoother(hs(t)/HI_IN) - smoother((hs(t) - HI_IN)/HI_BURST)",
      "hood": "smoother((hs(t) - HI_IN)/HI_BURST)*(1 - smoother((hs(t) - HI_HOLD)/HI_RELAX)) - HI_OVER*damp((hs(t) - HI_HOLD - 0.6*HI_RELAX)/HI_SETTLE, 2)",
      "lunge": "bump((hs(t) - HI_IN + 1)/HI_LUNGE_F)",
      "buzz": "jitter((hs(t) - BUZZ_F0)/BUZZ_F, BUZZ_K)",
      "tense": "smoother(rs(t)/CHARGE_F) - smoother((rs(t) - CHARGE_F)/RELEASE_F)",
      "flare": "smoother((rs(t) - CHARGE_F + 2)/8)*(1 - smoother((rs(t) - FLARE_HOLD)/FLARE_FALL))",
      "spin": "-WIND_DEG*smoother(rs(t)/CHARGE_F) + (SPIN_DEG + WIND_DEG)*smoother(max(0, (rs(t) - CHARGE_F)/SPIN_F)**SPIN_SNAP) + OVER_DEG*damp((rs(t) - OVER_F0)/OVER_F, 3)",
      "jolt": "round(TREMBLE_PX*jitter((rs(t) - 3)/(CHARGE_F - 2), TREMBLE_K))",
      "FY": "hover(t) + LIFT_PX*flare(t) - DIP_PX*tense(t) + HI_REAR_PX*rear(t) - HI_LUNGE_PX*lunge(t)",
      "FX": "drift(t)",
      "crown": "CLOSE_DEG*tense(t) - FLARE_DEG*flare(t) + HI_CLENCH*coil(t) - HI_FLARE*hood(t) + HI_QUIVER*buzz(t)",
      "pout": "PETAL_OUT + FLING*flare(t) - TUCK*tense(t) + HOOD_OUT*hood(t) - COIL_IN*coil(t)",
      "tilt": "TILT_DEG*sin(2*pi*CYC*tf(t)) - SPIN_ROLL*flare(t) - HI_LEAN*coil(t) + HI_STRIKE*lunge(t)"
    },
    "note": "round 10 (ours; Showdown has no Mega Glimmora animation). 330 frames = 9.9 s. Float measured on Showdown's floaters (base Glimmora, Bronzong, Claydol, Cosmoem, Nihilego): 3 floats of 90 frames (2.7 s), 7 px travel, crest broad / trough quick (wave skew), a sideways drift a quarter cycle behind (egg-shaped orbit) and a pendulum rock of TILT_DEG; petals trail the body by LAG_F frames. Whole pixels of FY / FX are style.pixel_bob's shift, the fraction is rendered (origin LOCCAM / LOCCAMX). Crown breathes on the float. Living petals (slow clock tq, 180 frames): each bends base -> tip (feeler_03 / _04), sways about its radial axis and bobs, phases stepping round the ring. Hiss, frames 90-149 (fast frames; float held at the crest): inhale 14 frames (rears 2 px, leans back 3 deg, crown clenches, petals tuck, curl in, ring winds back 6 deg), burst 5 frames (crown flares 20 deg, petals open into a wide hood: out 0.14, fanned 11 + 8 deg, pushed 5 px out on screen, inner spikes bristle, body strikes down 1 px), hiss held to frame 38 (petals buzz +-2.5 deg in 2-frame swings, neighbours opposite, crown quivers), relax 12 frames with a small overshoot. Spin, frames 210-299 (fast frames, one float cycle long): charge 20 frames, snap release, two turns coasting down, overshoot, settle. Frame 0 is the fitted rest pose on a whole pixel."
  },
